# Dates count only as whole words: "today's", "a-tomorrow" and "tomorrow/friday" stay text, while "tomorrow." counts.
file <<END
INBOX:
END
keys q
type Read today's paper
keys <Enter> q
type Fix a-tomorrow bug
keys <Enter> q
type Pick tomorrow/friday
keys <Enter> q
type Call mom tomorrow.
keys <Enter>
quit
saved <<END
INBOX:
	- Read today's paper
	- Fix a-tomorrow bug
	- Pick tomorrow/friday
	- Call mom. @start({today+1})
END
